flowchart LR
  B[Booking confirmation] --> BO[(Booking outbox)]
  G[Gate / ride transaction] --> VO[(Visits outbox)]
  BO --> P[Publisher: SKIP LOCKED]
  VO --> P
  P --> Q[(Durable local PostgreSQL queue)]
  Q --> W[Validate / dedupe / project]
  W --> F[(Reporting facts + completion ack)]
  W -->|Invalid after 3 attempts| D[(Dead letters)]
  D -->|Authorized redrive after fixing cause| Q
  F --> V[Read-only aggregate views]
  V --> M[Private Metabase dashboard]
  V --> A[Protected administrator analytics]
  P -. Future cloud transport / offline tested .-> S[SQS / DLQ]
  S -. Commit before delete .-> W
